    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a bad mood or a slump though. it's deeper. it feels like the purpose is just... finished. like i've completed the arc and there's nothing left to write. it feels almost more honest to just acknowledge that the well is dry than to keep pretending i can still produce something meaningful. it feels like i'm just haunting my own life at this point.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
